    "year2018HouseholdSurveyRedesignCaveat": "The Household Survey ledger format was comprehensively revised in 2018. Top-level labels are matched, but 2017/2018 household-size expenditure profiles may not be fully comparable; this is a stability diagnostic, not a seamless time series.",
    "lfsSpecialWeightsCaveat": "setai-n.xls is published as the special tabulation used for each year's January Household Survey adjustment. Household Survey sample-design documentation defines the adjustment distribution as the Labour Force Survey household-size distribution averaged over the latest 12 months; it is not confirmed as a calendar-year average. It is not an annual IV-4 household-count series and is not the 2025 CTI joint household-size-by-age reference distribution. Sources: https://www.stat.go.jp/data/kakei/pdf/18gai00.pdf p.25 and https://www.stat.go.jp/data/kakei/setai_bunpu.html."
